# Ready Set Mail Worker: optional secrets for local development (`npm run dev`).
# Copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored). A deployed instance gets its secrets from `npm run setup`
# (docs/self-hosting.md); set others there with `npm run wrangler -- secret put <NAME>`.

# Optional: a Cloudflare API token the Worker uses to write DNS and Email Routing.
# Permissions and what each is for: docs/self-hosting.md#permissions
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
